# # /florilegium/
#
# Permanent identifiers for Florilegium, a reading workspace whose records are
# W3C Web Annotations: its namespace and its versioned JSON-LD context.
#
# https://w3id.org/florilegium/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://jt-halbert.github.io/florilegium-ns/
#
# For example:
#   https://w3id.org/florilegium/ns            the namespace page
#   https://w3id.org/florilegium/ns/v1.jsonld  the JSON-LD context, version 1
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# J.T. Halbert
# jthalbert@gmail.com
# GitHub username: jt-halbert

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://jt-halbert.github.io/florilegium-ns/$1 [R=302,L]
